# The database the project configures, and a query through its driver.
Shot db
Alt :db listing the one database the project configures — its driver, its file, read-only and ready — then :query selecting five users through that driver, as a table with the row count
Caption :query runs SQL through your project's own driver, read-only unless you say -w. :db shows where the database came from.
Headline Query your database through your driver
Promo 4:5
Host shop
Setup gluon init -no-prompt -write -local
Args -host .
Grid 96x24
Line :db
Line :query SELECT id, email, plan FROM users ORDER BY id LIMIT 5
Screenshot
